    - target: {fileID: 114209646759658074, guid: ccaa3eaf37d20af4bbcd41af119e979f,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Blush Canyon Zone is an example of \"Speed Level Design.\" \n\nCreated
        in only 2 short hours, Blush Canyon features minimalistic textures and lighting
        in order to demonstrate how quickly levels can be created. \n\nThe level
        also features non-linear elements such as a switch that must be pressed in
        order to progress to the Goal Ring.\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
